{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play the role of Walter, the only one brave villager, to recover the stolen treasure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jump, avoid obstacles and eliminate enemies by landing on their heads!  Collect gems, which you exchange for everything available in the game.   Customize your character by choosing from a variety of passive and active skills.  Do everything in your power to return the stone to its place!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/extras/Walter_Adventure_Patch_0.0.15_ENG.png?t=1745863952\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Upgrade your character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>As you traverse the levels you have the chance to find a wishing fountain where you can upgrade your character, you can upgrade almost every thing about your character.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>From buying skills that will help you in various situations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/extras/Walter_Adventure_Patch_0.0.15_ENG2.png?t=1745863952\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>By upgrading these skills or a regular character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/extras/Walter_Adventure_Patch_0.0.15_2_.png?t=1745863952\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>As far as unlocking passive skills that other skins have.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/extras/Walter_Adventure_Patch_0.0.15_3_.png?t=1745863952\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And all this for currency earned in the game, with no micropayments or premium currencies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Avoid deadly traps on each map, those visible and those hard to see.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each level is filled with a mass of obstacles, creatures and hindrances that are just waiting for you to be the one to die on them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/extras/Walter_Adventure_Patch_0.0.15_4.png?t=1745863952\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Remember, your character will have something to say after the death you've led to.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Not necessarily a nice one.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/extras/Walter_Adventure_Patch_0.0.15_5_.png?t=1745863952\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Retrieve the teleportation stones and become the hero of your village!And most importantly, remember to have fun, because that's what games are for.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681830?t=1745863952","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/9c915fc0727435bfba4a89fb501ab2c6e24ba249/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745863952","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/a961b6422fb4641755a8301d1779d14140cb0ce9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745863952","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/a961b6422fb4641755a8301d1779d14140cb0ce9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745863952","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":6