_Adventure_Patch_0.0.15_3_.png?t=1745863952\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And all this for currency earned in the game, with no micropayments or premium currencies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Avoid deadly traps on each map, those visible and those hard to see.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each level is filled with a mass of obstacles, creatures and hindrances that are just waiting for you to be the one to die on them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/extras/Walter_Adventure_Patch_0.0.15_4.png?t=1745863952\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Remember, your character will have something to say after the death you've led to.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Not necessarily a nice one.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/extras/Walter_Adventure_Patch_0.0.15_5_.png?t=1745863952\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Retrieve the teleportation stones and become the hero of your village!And most importantly, remember to have fun, because that's what games are for.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  </h2>","developers":["LumeBit"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681830/0096f5ecac78b0fcbd664c24b31dff458a34beeb/header.jpg?t=1745863952","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257132269,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132269/movie480.mp4?t=1745863950","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132269/movie_max.mp4?t=1745863950"},"name":"Walter Adventure","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap